  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.02,
      "text": "What if Tanjiro could hear"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.02,
      "end": 2.18,
      "text": "demons' thoughts?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.18,
      "end": 3.68,
      "text": "The universe added notifications with"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.68,
      "end": 5.1,
      "text": "no mute button available."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.1,
      "end": 6.68,
      "text": "This is an invented ability."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.68,
      "end": 8.08,
      "text": "Understanding suffering might help him"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.08,
      "end": 9.06,
      "text": "protect people."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.06,
      "end": 10.0,
      "text": "Instead, fear and memories arrive"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 10.9,
      "text": "together."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.9,
      "end": 11.82,
      "text": "Welcome to a cursed open"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.82,
      "end": 12.84,
      "text": "-plan office."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.84,
      "end": 13.86,
      "text": "Terrible acoustics."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 14.94,
      "text": "Zenitsu asks if it helps,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.94,
      "end": 15.6,
      "text": "screams."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.6,
      "end": 16.44,
      "text": "Outstanding."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.44,
      "end": 18.24,
      "text": "His own emergency broadcast system."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.24,
      "end": 18.94,
      "text": "A demon thinks it means"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.94,
      "end": 20.06,
      "text": "no harm."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.06,
      "end": 21.56,
      "text": "Reassuring, except hearing a thought"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.56,
      "end": 22.702430846605196,
      "text": "doesn't make it reliable."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.702430846605196,
      "end": 24.3424375,
      "text": "Frightened people can hurt others."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.3424375,
      "end": 26.1624375,
      "text": "Confident memories can mislead."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.1624375,
      "end": 27.4824375,
      "text": "Empathy still needs evidence and"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.4824375,
      "end": 28.6224375,
      "text": "practical boundaries."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.6224375,
      "end": 29.8424375,
      "text": "Nezuko reminds him why he"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.8424375,
      "end": 30.6424375,
      "text": "cares."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.6424375,
      "end": 32.1024375,
      "text": "Someone can deserve compassion without"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.1024375,
      "end": 34.0424375,
      "text": "everybody else surrendering their safety."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0424375,
      "end": 35.5424375,
      "text": "He protects bystanders first, then"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.5424375,
      "end": 36.7024375,
      "text": "listens."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.7024375,
      "end": 37.4224375,
      "text": "He installed a firewall on"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.4224375,
      "end": 38.382437499999995,
      "text": "that enormous heart."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.382437499999995,
      "end": 39.5024375,
      "text": "A hidden memory suggests a"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.5024375,
      "end": 41.0024375,
      "text": "missing person's location."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.0024375,
      "end": 42.0024375,
      "text": "He checks instead of trusting"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.0024375,
      "end": 42.902437500000005,
      "text": "blindly."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.902437500000005,
      "end": 43.75160659402068,
      "text": "The ability helps."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.75160659402068,
      "end": 45.251625,
      "text": "Zenitsu asks if Tanjiro can"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.251625,
      "end": 46.191625,
      "text": "mute him."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.191625,
      "end": 47.331624999999995,
      "text": "Different species, brother."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.331624999999995,
      "end": 48.171625,
      "text": "Your volume is a local"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.171625,
      "end": 49.411625,
      "text": "government issue."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.411625,
      "end": 50.811625,
      "text": "Understanding doesn't promise agreement or"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.811625,
      "end": 52.251625,
      "text": "painless solutions."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.251625,
      "end": 53.271625,
      "text": "The new ability changes his"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.271625,
      "end": 55.511624999999995,
      "text": "choices, not every consequence outside."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.511624999999995,
      "end": 56.951625,
      "text": "Tanjiro keeps his kindness and"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.951625,
      "end": 58.211625,
      "text": "learns restraint."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.211625,
      "end": 59.871624999999995,
      "text": "The upgrade wasn't hearing everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.871624999999995,
      "end": 60.971625,
      "text": "It was knowing when to listen."
    }
  ],
